          <h3 data-en="What is a 20-yard roll-off dumpster?" data-es="¿Qué es un contenedor roll-off de 20 yardas?">What is a 20-yard roll-off dumpster?</h3>
          <p data-html data-en="The 20-yard is one of our most versatile sizes. Dimensions: <strong>22 feet long, 8 feet wide, and 4 feet tall</strong>, open-top with a swing-door for walk-in loading. Twenty cubic yards of debris holds about 9 full-size pickup truck loads — enough capacity for nearly every residential project from a whole-house cleanout to a mid-size roofing tear-off." data-es="El de 20 yardas es uno de nuestros tamaños más versátiles. Dimensiones: <strong>22 pies de largo, 8 pies de ancho y 4 pies de alto</strong>, parte superior abierta con puerta batiente para cargar caminando. Veinte yardas cúbicas de escombros equivalen a unas 9 cargas de camioneta — suficiente capacidad para casi cualquier proyecto residencial, desde una limpieza de casa completa hasta una remoción de techo mediana.">The 20-yard is one of our most versatile sizes. Dimensions: <strong>22 feet long, 8 feet wide, and 4 feet tall</strong>, open-top with a swing-door for walk-in loading. Twenty cubic yards of debris holds about 9 full-size pickup truck loads — enough capacity for nearly every residential project from a whole-house cleanout to a mid-size roofing tear-off.</p>
          <p data-en="If you've never rented a dumpster before and aren't sure which size to pick, the 20-yard is the safest default. The extra capacity over a 15-yard buys you breathing room, and the footprint still fits in most two-car driveways. It covers a wide range of projects — and customers rarely regret the choice." data-es="Si nunca has rentado un contenedor y no estás seguro de qué tamaño elegir, el de 20 yardas es la opción más segura. La capacidad extra sobre el de 15 yardas te da margen, y el espacio sigue cabiendo en la mayoría de los parqueos para dos autos. Cubre una amplia gama de proyectos — y los clientes rara vez se arrepienten.">If you've never rented a dumpster before and aren't sure which size to pick, the 20-yard is the safest default. The extra capacity over a 15-yard buys you breathing room, and the footprint still fits in most two-car driveways. It covers a wide range of projects — and customers rarely regret the choice.</p>

          <h3 data-en="Common 20-yard projects in the DMV" data-es="Proyectos comunes de 20 yardas en el DMV">Common 20-yard projects in the DMV</h3>
          <p data-en="Across Prince George's County, Montgomery County, Bowie, Laurel, and the rest of our service area, these are the projects that almost always land on the 20-yard:" data-es="En Prince George's County, Montgomery County, Bowie, Laurel y el resto de nuestra área de servicio, estos son los proyectos que casi siempre terminan en el de 20 yardas:">Across Prince George's County, Montgomery County, Bowie, Laurel, and the rest of our service area, these are the projects that almost always land on the 20-yard:</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Whole-house cleanouts.</strong> Three to four bedrooms of furniture, mattresses, carpet, and accumulated household goods. The 20-yard is the standard for estate, hoarder, or pre-sale cleanouts on a typical DMV single-family home." data-es="<strong>Limpiezas de casa completa.</strong> Tres a cuatro habitaciones de muebles, colchones, alfombra y enseres acumulados del hogar. El de 20 yardas es el estándar para limpiezas de patrimonio, acumulación o previas a la venta en una casa unifamiliar típica del DMV."><strong>Whole-house cleanouts.</strong> Three to four bedrooms of furniture, mattresses, carpet, and accumulated household goods. The 20-yard is the standard for estate, hoarder, or pre-sale cleanouts on a typical DMV single-family home.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Multi-room remodels.</strong> A kitchen plus one or two bathrooms, or a full main-floor gut. The 20-yard absorbs cabinets, drywall, flooring, tile, framing scraps, and fixtures without needing a swap." data-es="<strong>Remodelaciones de varias habitaciones.</strong> Una cocina más uno o dos baños, o una renovación completa de la planta principal. El de 20 yardas absorbe gabinetes, paneles de yeso, pisos, azulejo, restos de estructura y accesorios sin necesidad de un cambio."><strong>Multi-room remodels.</strong> A kitchen plus one or two bathrooms, or a full main-floor gut. The 20-yard absorbs cabinets, drywall, flooring, tile, framing scraps, and fixtures without needing a swap.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Mid-size roofing tear-offs.</strong> Up to roughly 30 squares of asphalt shingles is a comfortable fit. A typical DMV single-family roof clocks in under 25 squares." data-es="<strong>Remociones de techo medianas.</strong> Hasta aproximadamente 30 cuadros de tejas de asfalto caben cómodamente. Un techo unifamiliar típico del DMV ronda los 25 cuadros."><strong>Mid-size roofing tear-offs.</strong> Up to roughly 30 squares of asphalt shingles is a comfortable fit. A typical DMV single-family roof clocks in under 25 squares.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Basement-to-attic estate cleanouts.</strong> Decades of stored items in a 2,000+ sq ft home — boxes, furniture, paneling, old appliances (no freon), broken-down playsets." data-es="<strong>Limpiezas de patrimonio de sótano a ático.</strong> Décadas de objetos almacenados en una casa de más de 2,000 pies cuadrados — cajas, muebles, paneles, electrodomésticos viejos (sin freón), juegos infantiles desarmados."><strong>Basement-to-attic estate cleanouts.</strong> Decades of stored items in a 2,000+ sq ft home — boxes, furniture, paneling, old appliances (no freon), broken-down playsets.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Garage demolition or shed teardown.</strong> A small detached structure including framing, roofing, siding, and concrete (concrete priced separately)." data-es="<strong>Demolición de garaje o derribo de cobertizo.</strong> Una pequeña estructura independiente que incluye estructura, techo, revestimiento y concreto (el concreto se cotiza por separado)."><strong>Garage demolition or shed teardown.</strong> A small detached structure including framing, roofing, siding, and concrete (concrete priced separately).</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 data-en="How much weight can a 20-yard hold?" data-es="¿Cuánto peso aguanta un contenedor de 20 yardas?">How much weight can a 20-yard hold?</h3>
          <p data-html data-en="Weight is the thing to watch on a 20-yard. Household cleanouts rarely exceed 1,500 lb, and even a full multi-room remodel usually finishes under 3,000 lb. Pricing is quoted per project, and heavy materials are quoted separately — tell us what you're loading and we'll price it up front." data-es="El peso es lo que hay que vigilar en un 20 yardas. Las limpiezas del hogar rara vez superan las 1,500 lb, e incluso una remodelación completa de varias habitaciones suele quedar por debajo de las 3,000 lb. El precio se cotiza por proyecto, y los materiales pesados se cotizan por separado — dinos qué vas a cargar y lo cotizamos por adelantado.">Weight is the thing to watch on a 20-yard. Household cleanouts rarely exceed 1,500 lb, and even a full multi-room remodel usually finishes under 3,000 lb. Pricing is quoted per project, and heavy materials are quoted separately — tell us what you're loading and we'll price it up front.</p>
          <p data-en="Watch the weight on jobs that are mostly shingles, tile, plaster, or concrete. A 30-square roof tear-off is heavy on its own. Heavy aggregates like dirt, concrete, and asphalt are priced per material and only come in 10-, 15-, and 20-yard sizes. If you're doing a heavy-debris-only project, ask us about a material-specific quote — sometimes you pay less by sizing differently." data-es="Cuida el peso en trabajos que son en su mayoría tejas, azulejo, yeso o concreto. Una remoción de techo de 30 cuadros ya es pesada por sí sola. Los agregados pesados como tierra, concreto y asfalto se cotizan por material y solo vienen en tamaños de 10, 15 y 20 yardas. Si tu proyecto es solo de escombros pesados, pregúntanos por una cotización específica del material — a veces pagas menos eligiendo otro tamaño.">Watch the weight on jobs that are mostly shingles, tile, plaster, or concrete. A 30-square roof tear-off is heavy on its own. Heavy aggregates like dirt, concrete, and asphalt are priced per material and only come in 10-, 15-, and 20-yard sizes. If you're doing a heavy-debris-only project, ask us about a material-specific quote — sometimes you pay less by sizing differently.</p>

          <h3 data-en="Where will the 20-yard fit on my property?" data-es="¿Dónde cabrá el de 20 yardas en mi propiedad?">Where will the 20-yard fit on my property?</h3>
          <p data-en="The 20-yard is still residential-friendly. The 22-ft length is the key constraint:" data-es="El de 20 yardas sigue siendo apto para zonas residenciales. La longitud de 22 ft es la limitación clave:">The 20-yard is still residential-friendly. The 22-ft length is the key constraint:</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Two-car driveways.</strong> The most common placement. The 20 takes up roughly one car's worth of length plus some clearance for the door swing." data-es="<strong>Parqueos para dos autos.</strong> La ubicación más común. El de 20 ocupa más o menos el largo de un auto más algo de espacio para la apertura de la puerta."><strong>Two-car driveways.</strong> The most common placement. The 20 takes up roughly one car's worth of length plus some clearance for the door swing.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Long single-car driveway.</strong> You'll need a long, straight run — our dispatcher confirms fit when you book." data-es="<strong>Parqueo largo para un auto.</strong> Necesitarás un tramo recto largo — nuestro despacho confirma que cabe cuando reservas."><strong>Long single-car driveway.</strong> You'll need a long, straight run — our dispatcher confirms fit when you book.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Side yard.</strong> Possible if the truck swing has room — send a photo and we'll spec it." data-es="<strong>Patio lateral.</strong> Posible si el camión tiene espacio para maniobrar — envía una foto y lo evaluamos."><strong>Side yard.</strong> Possible if the truck swing has room — send a photo and we'll spec it.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Public street (with permit).</strong> If a driveway placement isn't possible, your jurisdiction can issue a temporary right-of-way permit. We'll point you to the right office and pass the permit fee through at cost." data-es="<strong>Calle pública (con permiso).</strong> Si no es posible colocarlo en el parqueo, tu jurisdicción puede emitir un permiso temporal de derecho de paso. Te indicaremos la oficina correcta y te trasladaremos el costo del permiso sin recargo."><strong>Public street (with permit).</strong> If a driveway placement isn't possible, your jurisdiction can issue a temporary right-of-way permit. We'll point you to the right office and pass the permit fee through at cost.</li>
          </ul>
